    {
      "type": "model",
      "message": {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Now I have all the information. Let me solve the problem.\n\n**Problem:** A box has 5 balls labeled 1–5. Draw 3 times with replacement. Let X = number of distinct balls that appear at least once. Find E(X).\n\n**Solution using indicator variables:**\n\nFor each ball $i$ (i = 1,...,5), define indicator $X_i = 1$ if ball $i$ appears at least once in the 3 draws, else 0.\n\nThen $X = X_1 + X_2 + X_3 + X_4 + X_5$.\n\nProbability ball $i$ never appears in 3 draws: $\\left(\\frac{4}{5}\\right)^3 = \\frac{64}{125}$.\n\nSo $P(X_i = 1) = 1 - \\frac{64}{125} = \\frac{61}{125}$.\n\nBy linearity of expectation:\n$$E(X) = 5 \\times \\frac{61}{125} = \\frac{305}{125} = \\frac{61}{25} = 2.44$$",
        "tool_calls": [
          {
            "id": "call_387bebf46a05452bad97112d",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "function",
            "function": {
              "name": "submit_solution",
              "arguments": "{\"region_id\": \"region_art_0014_01\", \"final_answer\": \"E(X) = 61/25 = 2.44\", \"reasoning\": \"题目：箱中有标号1~5的5个球，有放回地取3次，X表示至少被取出一次的球的个数，求E(X)。\\n\\n用指示变量法（期望的线性性）：\\n对每个球 i（i=1,2,3,4,5）定义指示变量 X_i：若球 i 在3次抽取中至少出现一次，则 X_i=1，否则 X_i=0。\\n则 X = X_1 + X_2 + X_3 + X_4 + X_5。\\n\\n单次抽取取不到球 i 的概率为 4/5，3次都取不到球 i 的概率为 (4/5)^3 = 64/125。\\n所以 P(X_i = 1) = 1 - 64/125 = 61/125。\\n\\n由期望的线性性：\\nE(X) = E(X_1) + ... + E(X_5) = 5 × (61/125) = 305/125 = 61/25 = 2.44。\\n\\n（验证：也可用分布法。P(X=1)=5/125=1/25；P(X=2)=C(5,2)·(2^3-2)/125=10·6/125=60/125；P(X=3)=C(5,3)·3!/125=10·6/125=60/125；P(X=4)=0（3次最多出现3个不同球）；P(X=5)=0。E(X)=1·5/125+2·60/125+3·60/125=305/125=61/25，一致。）\"}"
            }
